   "section": "6",
   "kind": "NEW",
   "text": "Check what matters to you against the retailer's or the manufacturer's own information before you rely on it.",
   "after": "Verdicts, summaries, specifications and recommendations are generated by AI from public information and may be incomplete, wrong or out of date.",
